config NFC_SN100X
	tristate "NXP SN100T NCI I2C transport"
	depends on I2C && NFC_NCI && GPIOLIB
	help
	  Standard Linux NFC/NCI transport for NXP SN100T. Uses resident
	  firmware and retains shared NFCC/eSE VEN on close. Firmware download,
	  eSE access and active NFC suspend/wakeup are not supported.
	  If built as a module, this driver is called sn100x.
